e Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nWhen Tommy participated in the community election, he asked his friends to add fake votes to the number of votes he got so that he could win. When the results were announced, Tommy realized that he had won the election, he covered his mouth and gave an expression of awe while thanking those who voted for him.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Tommy ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Annoyance & Delight\nB) Anticipation & Surprise\nC) Guilt & Delight\nD) Amusement & Annoyance\nE) Amusement & Guilt\nF) Anticipation & Guilt\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Tommy feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) He knew that he would win the election due to his friends' help & He cheated to win the election\nB) He knew that he would win the election due to his friends' help & He was nervous about the election result\nC) He knew that he would win the election due to his friends' help & He didn't know what the results would be\nD) He had confidence in his popularity & He knew that his friends voted fairly for him\nE) He had confidence in his popularity & He knew that he would win the election due to his friends' help\nF) He was nervous about the election result & He didn't know what the results would be","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010982265451450477,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a63f9aa9dc5a833d97b0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483775604,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:42:55","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourc